cues.clause_text:
But, as it was, I stood there
with only the weapons and the powers that Nature had endowed me
with—hands, feet, and teeth;

and I
could hang over you with untiring tenderness, though you gave me no
smile in return;

and her
alarms being now removed, she was at leisure to feel a great deal of
curiosity to see the house herself;

and in less than
two years he got drunk and fell off of the shot-tower, and spread
himself out so that he was just a kind of a layer, as you may say;

I have
devoted my creator, the select specimen of all that is worthy of love
and admiration among men, to misery;
